      ],
      "content": "SP 81 SE 5/7 ASTON CLINTON GREEN END STREET north east side Dormer Cottage (Formerly listed as Dormers) II House. C17 altered. Timber framed and colourwashed brick, old tile roof, rendered chimney to RH of centre, ridge level higher to RH, 3 gabled eaves dormers with 3-light diamond leaded casements, 1-storey and attic,halfglazed door to LH of centre with a 3-light casement to LH, and 2 to RH, all with diamond leaded glazing and segmental heads. Rainwater head (possibly reset) dated 1671. Listing NGR: SP8809212332"
    }
